WEBVTT

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:01.634
speaks slowly with his own quiet voice,

00:12:01.634 --> 00:12:03.938
and works every day

00:12:03.938 --> 00:12:09.148
to gain more movement in his paralyzed body.

00:12:09.148 --> 00:12:11.499
But the work will never be finished.

00:12:11.499 --> 00:12:16.212
As he says, "I'm living in a broken world,

00:12:16.212 --> 00:12:19.243
and there is holy work to do."

00:12:19.243 --> 00:12:21.263
Thank you.

00:12:21.263 --> 00:12:25.120
(Applause)